Package: qtcd
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCH_PLACEHOLDER
Depends: systemd
Suggests: m17-gateway
Maintainer: Jim Ancona, N1ADJ <jim@anconafamily.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jancona/qtc
Description: QTC store-and-forward messaging node for M17
 qtcd joins the QTC network and presents itself to an M17 gateway as a
 reflector (M17-QTC), taking SMS on its QTC module into store-and-forward
 messaging by callsign and by room. Voice passes through to the upstream
 reflector unchanged. Includes the qtc command-line tool.
 .
 Experimental: messages are not private, and callsigns are not verified.
